l there are  now 300 000 potentially missing ballots  which i will tell you about  i will tell you all of what is going on  some states  which count in person and report  in-person ballots first  and then start counting the mail-in  ballots we knew of a potential red  mirage scenario where states would  look like they were going trump and as  the ballots are counted  they start looking towards biden we  already have two examples of this  wisconsin and michigan they are not  final numbers yet but wisconsin and  michigan  all night yesterday even until midnight  and later  were looking like wow trump's crushing  michigan  and slowly but surely the numbers have  shifted and are now  leaning in favor of joseph r biden jr so  panic does not serve us well in these  situations  we don't think clearly when we're  panicking and importantly  we're panicking over things we can't  control  if we learn about ballots being thrown  out then yes we activate  and we start calling the people who need  to be called  and complaining and making a lot of  noise but merely waiting for ballots to  be counted when we anticipated a red  mirage scenario doesn't serve us well  and in fact as i tweeted last night  around 12 30 in the morning  remember how we were warned about a red  mirage  and not to panic at midnight on tuesday  i'm going to bed many vote counts don't  even resume  until the morning and indeed that's what  i did  and indeed as the vote counts have  resumed the numbers have started to  shift in joe biden's favor in a number  of states  i'm speaking generally now i will get to  specifics in the next segment now as a  quick reminder in the midst of all of  this  remember we still have a pandemic we had  another  nearly hundred thousand cases yesterday  and on top of all of the normal delays  that can sometimes happen  on top of the delays that we're aware of  in the mail on top of all of these other  things  most states are also being relatively  safe when it comes to the pandemic in  terms of election staff  and counting and all of these things so  let's not forget about that reality  as we discuss the election results so  momentarily we're going to do a deep  dive into the presidential map  in terms of the senate we still don't  know who will control the senate right  now democrats have flipped  two seats john hickenlooper won in  colorado  and mark kelly defeating the incumbent  republican vile  republican martha mcsally in arizona  republicans have also flipped one seat  we expected that democratic senator doug  jones would lose in alabama and he did  so that's  democrats plus two republicans plus one  that is one seat in the direction of  democrats so far  otherwise counting continues in the  house of representatives votes  still being counted as of one moment  earlier today  democrats securing 190 seats flipping  two from republicans republicans  securing 181  flipping six meaning a net gain of  four for republicans with 64 seats  remaining to count i'm going to take  some time  to go through the presidential numbers  in a moment  this is going to take some time as long  as we're confident  in the votes being counted it doesn't  bother me although i understand  it is stressful and anxiety producing  the problem we're up against is donald  trump is trying to end the election now  donald trump has declared victory donald  trump declared that he won  states which it's not actually clear  that he won  and we know of hundreds of thousands of  votes that are potentially missing and  we're going to cover  all of it for you today if you've been  watching the show you've probably heard  me talk about how much i love my helix  mattress well i was really excited to  hear that helix has launched  a new company called all form which  makes premium customizable  sofas and chairs with the same level of  quality  and comfort that i expect from these  guys and all form is one of our sponsors  today  they're giving you twenty percent off at  allforum.